  "summary": "Glendale, AZ police used their real-time crime center, including drones tracking a stolen SUV, to arrest Jessy Simpkins, who was found to have outstanding felony warrants from Florida for sexual assault of a minor.",
  "key_quotes": [
    {
      "quote": "Glendale police say officers recovered a stolen car that led them to a child sex predator who was wanted in another state. The police department said it was all possible because of their real-time crime center.",
      "paragraph_idx": 2
    },
    {
      "quote": "To keep the trail from going cold, officers got drones up in the air following the truck to a residential area, all while giving officers on the ground live information on what they were walking into.",
      "paragraph_idx": 5
    }
  ],
